{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0132_1000_p", "source_sha256": "40c3ad1af7716cba943c363d8d9ce2a0606f0f8e2f0066680c051bd9062ee70d", "ja": "（あの後ろ姿は……星梨花？　鏡に向かって\n舌を出しているようだが、何をしてるんだろう？）", "zh": "（那个背影是……星梨花？\n她好像对着镜子在吐舌头，不知道在做什么？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0132_1001_p", "source_sha256": "71f29222fd71cc3cb50ad49ad0302c53a12e7587f1699a3e7ad4bcd9634c7c52", "ja": "お疲れさま、星梨花。\nどうかしたのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，星梨花。\n你怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0132_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "8dd529187e88b9311e8546fbffe699f08adfa1d1dec8c1d7e861ccf0c52c8373", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nえっと……あっ、また失敗しちゃいました。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n那个……啊，我又失败了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0132_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "735010736cde3305477f03976d1d002e6918dc6240dae3103271af7fd2b47528", "ja": "あの、どうしたらからかさオバケみたいに、\n舌を出したままお話ができるんでしょう？", "zh": "请问要怎么做才能跟唐伞妖怪一样，\n吐着舌头说话呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0132_1004_p", "source_sha256": "18d78538d6dad707bee62f19a72721aeb93d3b234cebaac1a61a620b2c322e23", "ja": "からかさオバケ……この前の仕事の？", "zh": "唐伞妖怪……是之前工作的那个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0132_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "fadbc015e259a09b21cba42d0a62e5a0460c071a3facf9cb6b910fe068b6ab60", "ja": "はい！　からかさオバケは、ずっと舌を出してるのに、\n上手にお話ができるんですよね？", "zh": "是的！唐伞妖怪明明一直吐着舌头，\n讲话却还是很清楚，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0132_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "88c2a200521c5b34d59012345c6807ba43fb433eeeb49529311e371b09a3f38e", "ja": "わたし、何度も練習してるんですけど、\n失敗しちゃって。上手に話せなくて……。", "zh": "我练习了好几次，结果都失败，\n讲话讲不清楚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0132_1007_p", "source_sha256": "41bc73390e407691a6406683604a5c0e6c454ed862f471b15e65cbddd628e4ac", "ja": "そうだな……いつか本物に会えたら、\nコツを教えてもらおう。", "zh": "这个嘛……要是哪天遇到了真正的唐伞妖怪，\n就请它传授一下诀窍吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0132_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "8e15dfa33c623bc42571d733f11ccdb5fcbf121b1078630a910abe4a161e391e", "ja": "はい！　{$P$}さん、\n見つけたら、わたしにも教えてくださいね♪", "zh": "好的！{$P$}先生，\n如果找到它了，请你也要告诉我喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
